OL,3,APoundland unable to buy new stock as
OL,4,Afears over collapse grow
OL,5,
OL,6,FPressure is building on Gordon
OL,7,FBrothers, which bought Poundland for #1
OL,8,Flast June, after the owner rejected a
OL,9,Ftakeover bid that could have saved the
OL,10,Fthousands of jobs currently at risk.
OL,11,FGordon Brothers has been approached for
OL,12,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
