OL,3,ATrump questions midterm elections
OL,4,Aintegrity after previously accepting
OL,5,Aresults
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has
OL,8,Fquestioned the legitimacy of the
OL,9,Fmidterm election results in which
OL,10,FRepublicans suffered sweeping losses,
OL,11,Fdays after saying he would accept the
OL,12,Foutcome.
OL,14,F"Does anybody really believe that this
OL,15,F'Election' was honest. How could the
OL,16,FPolls be so wrong?" Trump wrote on
OL,17,FTruth Social on Monday.
OL,19,FThis appeared to contradict what he
OL,20,Ftold the New York Times on election
OL,21,Fnight that he was "absolutely willing"
OL,22,Fto accept the results.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
