OL,3,ATurkey steel factory blast kills at
OL,4,Aleast 16 people
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 16 people have died and 13
OL,7,Fothers have been injured in an
OL,8,Fexplosion at an iron and steel factory
OL,9,Fnear the port city of Izmir in western
OL,10,FTurkey.
OL,12,FAll those killed and injured were
OL,13,Fworkers at the Habas plant, one of the
OL,14,Fcountry's leading steel producers,
OL,15,Fauthorities said. Footage from the
OL,16,Fscene showed a large fire inside the
OL,17,Ffacility and a towering column of smoke
OL,18,Frising into the air.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
